{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "notes": [
    "Golden dataset for order extraction (plan §38-§40).",
    "`expected` holds post-pipeline values: what /v1/orders/extract must return.",
    "A null expectation is an assertion that the model did NOT invent a value;",
    "these are the anti-hallucination cases and are compared exactly.",
    "`accept` lists alternative wordings tolerated for free-text fields.",
    "Numeric fields and enums are always compared exactly."
